    {
      "id": "note-travel-in",
      "name": "Note: in",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -100,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 620,
        "height": 840,
        "content": "## 1 The message comes in\nWhen you run an eval, the kit sends each test email or Mattermost message (a **case**) to **Case in** (`input.email`, `input.message`). **Read the rules** loads all the owner's rules of this engine (`usecases/travel/n8n/rules/*.md`; kit UI → **Rules**, engine n8n).\n\n**See the data of one eval case:** kit results → the case → **n8n execution ↗** → double-click a node."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-travel-read",
      "name": "Note: read",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 540,
        "height": 840,
        "content": "## 2 Read message (AI)\nOne model call: what it is about, who, which days.\nPrompt: **Read message** > Chat Messages > Message.\nThe fields: **Read model** > Options > Response Format.\n**Message fields** reads the answer."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-travel-events",
      "name": "Note: events",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1060,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 840,
        "content": "## 3 Look things up (no AI)\nWhich events are on those days?\nThe tool nodes ask the kit's **tools server** on your laptop (`/call/<tool>`). It reads the files in `data/`.\nMore context (trains): copy the node, change the tool in the URL and the fields."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-travel-tasks",
      "name": "Note: tasks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1360,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 540,
        "height": 840,
        "content": "## 4 Find tasks (AI)\n**The main prompt is here**: **Find tasks** > Chat Messages > Message (the steps). Change one thing, Publish, run the eval again.\n**Tasks model** > Options > Response Format forces the result shape of the case (`output.schema.json`).\n**Read result** reads the answer."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-travel-out",
      "name": "Note: out",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 2,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 840,
        "content": "## 5 Result out\nSends the result to the kit.\nAfter an edit: **Publish** (top right). The eval runs only the published version, and saves it to `n8n/workflow.json` and `n8n/prompts/`."
      }
    }
